  "body": "Nestled in one of the Whangaparaoa Peninsula's most desirable pockets, this two-bedroom home offers the ultimate seaside lifestyle. Whether you are searching for an affordable entry-level property to kickstart family life or a low-maintenance coastal lock-and-leave, this prime location delivers everything right to your doorstep.  \r\n\r\nModern, and stylish, this fully fenced home is ideal for a young family, a work-from-home setup or retirees alike.\r\n\r\nStroll down the road for morning swims, weekend paddleboarding, or evening walks along beautiful Big Manly Beach Whangaparaoa School and local early childhood centres are just moments away, making the morning school run completely stress-free.\r\n\r\nEnjoy local cafes, bakery runs, parks, and essential amenities just a short walk or drive up the road. \r\nOpportunities to secure a foothold in a premier Manly location don't last long. Embrace the beachside lifestyle you've been dreaming of!",
